  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Second Ulaanbaatar Services Improvement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the Second Ulaanbaatar Services Improvement Project is to provide improved water supply to the urban poor in a sustainable manner.  Key indicators are:  (a) number of persons served by each kiosk in the project ger areas; (b) percentage of kiosks in the project areas which are connected to the piped network; and (c) financial status of USAG.</narrative>
  </description>
